# Built binaries. `make -C hub build-portal` writes hub/bin/aql-hub, which is a
# ~15 MB artifact that `git add -A` would happily commit — `dist` being ignored
# is not the same thing, and `git check-ignore a b` exits 0 when only ONE of
# them matches, which is an easy way to convince yourself otherwise.
hub/bin/
controller/bin/
e2e/bin/
